["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">討論</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうろん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">辩论；讨论</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123897\"><ruby>討論<rp>(</rp><rt>とうろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>継続<rp>(</rp><rt>けいぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することを<ruby>動議<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I move that we continue the discussion.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠ざかる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおざかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">远去；渐远；逐渐消失；淡去；疏远；产生隔阂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103347\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>政治<rp>(</rp><rt>せいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>遠<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ざかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He distanced himself from politics.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠回り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおまわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绕路；迂回路线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193756\">もし<ruby>遠回<rp>(</rp><rt>とおまわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りでなければポストに<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please drop it in the mail if it&#x27;s not out of your way.</spa