(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He glanced at his wristwatch now and then.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">跡切れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とぎれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中断；结束；被打断；被打短；暂停</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174163\"><ruby>交通<rp>(</rp><rt>こうつう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れにはとぎれがなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There was no gap in the stream of traffic.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">説く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">解释；宣讲；倡导；劝说；说服；劝导；敦促</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95842\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>説<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きさとして<ruby>非<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>認<rp>(</rp><rt>みと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I convinced him of his fault.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特技</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特技；绝技；专门技能</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"j