w\" lang=\"ja\">特有</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特有的；独有的；特征性的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">研ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">磨利；磨锐；磨；研磨；淘洗；洗米；擦亮；抛光；打磨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111443\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はナイフを<ruby>研<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He was sharpening a knife.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">刺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とげ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刺；棘；尖刺；刺；扎入肉中的异物；卡在喉咙里的东西（如鱼刺）；尖刻的言辞；刺耳的话</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200380\">どのバラにもとげがあるように<ruby>人生<rp>(</rp><rt>じんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>悲<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しみがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Life has its sorrows, as every rose has its thorns.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:遂げる\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遂げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">达成；实现</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>急速<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅうそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>発展<rp>(</rp><rt>はってん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>遂<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">这个城市实现了飞速发展。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">床</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">床；床铺；卧具；病床；病榻；壁龛；河床；溪床；苗床；育苗床；榻榻米的草芯；地板；楼板</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85917\"><ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れたのでもう<ruby>床<rp>(</rp><rt>とこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろうと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m tired, so I think I&#x27;ll turn in now.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">年頃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">としごろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大约的年纪；看起来的年龄；适婚年龄；成熟年龄；成年年龄；某个年纪时；某个时期；多年来；长期以来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193206\">もっと<ruby>分別<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があってもいい<ruby>年頃<rp>(</rp><rt>としごろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You&#x27;re old enough to know better.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戸締り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とじまり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../